flowchart TD
    A["Supported platform<br/>Nonempty collection opt-in"]:::service --> B["One retained session<br/>Seal and two-pass native sample"]:::job
    B --> C["Full policy authorization<br/>Canonical descriptor path join"]:::service
    C --> D["Complete saved registration join<br/>Reverify native baseline hashes"]:::db
    D --> E["Bounded walk from sampled heads<br/>Stop at exact saved heads or zero root<br/>Reuse shared parents; verify each new pair"]:::job
    E --> F["Pure ancestry verification<br/>Complete closure and parent-first order"]:::job
    F --> G["Successful final recheck<br/>Metadata, named seal and retained edges"]:::storage
    G --> H["Close descriptors; return historical evidence<br/>Keep saved receipt and checkout relation<br/>No admission or progress write"]:::service
    D -. "Any failed stage" .-> I["Unavailable<br/>No partial result or progress write"]:::external
    G -. "Failure" .-> I
